# PM/QA working docs (PRDs, TRDs, specs) — drafted locally for reference,
# not meant to be pushed/shared via the repo.
# (docs/* instead of docs/ — a whole-directory ignore can't be reopened
# per-file by a negation pattern below; this can.)
docs/*
# Exception: the app's factual page/route inventory is a tracked, shared
# reference (not a draft PRD/spec) — agents rely on it to avoid inventing
# pages that don't exist (see CLAUDE.md's "App Map" section).
!docs/app-map.md
